              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Marathi for to seethe, then the Marathi for to stop speaking to."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: विश्वासघात",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "विश्वासघात — viśvāsghāt — \"a betrayal\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "जवळच्या मित्रानेच विश्वासघात केला. javaḷcyā mitrānec viśvāsghāt kelā. It was a close friend who betrayed him."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "विश्वास, trust, + घात, a blow: विश्वासघात (viśvāsghāt) करणे, to betray."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "विश्वासघात (viśvāsghāt) is a tatsama, taken from Sanskrit viśvāsaghāta, \"destruction of confidence, treachery\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
