            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मी चूक केली, तरी आईने मला माफ केलं. mī cūk kelī, tarī āīne malā māph kelaṁ. I made a mistake, but Mother forgave me."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने मला माफ केलं, tyāne malā māph kelaṁ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "माफी मागणे, to apologise; the one forgiven takes -ला."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "माफ करणे (māph karṇe) is a Marathi phrase built on माफ, \"excused\", a loan from Persian muaf, usually traced to Arabic, with करणे."
            }
