            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Younger? (धाकटा, dhākṭā.) Elder? (थोरला, thorlā.) The only one? (एकुलता, ekultā.) Of a paternal uncle? (चुलत, culat.) Step-? (सावत्र, sāvatra.) Childhood? (बालपण, bālpaṇ.) Youth? (तारुण्य, tāruṇya.) Old age? (वार्धक्य, vārdhakya.) Age? (वय, vay.) A teenager? (किशोर, kiśor.) Pregnant? (गरोदर, garodar.) Childbirth? (बाळंतपण, bāḷantpaṇ.) Newborn? (तान्हा, tānhā.) To crawl? (रांगणे, rāṅgṇe.) To give to drink? (पाजणे, pājṇe.) Upbringing? (संगोपन, saṅgopan.) To take care of? (सांभाळणे, sāmbhāḷṇe.) To nurture? (जोपासणे, jopāsṇe.) To pamper? (लाड करणे, lāḍ karṇe.) To adopt? (दत्तक घेणे, dattak gheṇe.) A touch? (स्पर्श, sparśa.) To hug? (मिठी मारणे, miṭhī mārṇe.) To stroke? (गोंजारणे, goñjārṇe.) To pat? (थोपटणे, thopaṭṇe.) To caress? (कुरवाळणे, kurvāḷṇe.) A separation? (ताटातूट, tāṭātūṭ.) Bickering? (कुरबुर, kurbur.) To drift apart? (दुरावणे, durāvṇe.) To seethe? (धुसफुसणे, dhusphusṇe.) To stop speaking to? (अबोला धरणे, abolā dharṇe.) A betrayal? (विश्वासघात, viśvāsghāt.) To rankle? (बोचणे, bocṇe.) To goad? (डिवचणे, ḍivacṇe.) To rebuke? (खडसावणे, khaḍsāvṇe.) To forgive? (माफ करणे, māph karṇe.)"
